 "applies_to": "Intesis 700 Series Air Gateway IN770AIR***O000 with the Panasonic application (U1U2 P-Link / S-Link), Modbus RTU / TCP server, user manual version 1.1.7 (2025-12-09).",
 "summary": "Intesis 700 Series gateway on Panasonic P-Link / S-Link (U1U2) systems serving Modbus RTU and TCP. Each indoor unit gets a 100-register block with control, temperatures, setpoint limits, error and occupancy values; outdoor units get pressure and demand-limit registers; low addresses hold occupancy setpoints and all-unit commands.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU",
  "TCP"
 ],
